# General Changes

[[!:https://clan.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/45164767/58160deebbd1c61d525f4e516690161858d1e95f.png]]((store.steampowered))
- [[https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1422450/view/694273194214819790]]((Deadlock - City Never Sleeps - Steam News))
[[!:https://store.steampowered.com/favicon.ico]]((store.steampowered))
- Added an option to hide player names above the health bar or to change it to hero names
- Names above health bar fade out with distance starting at 25m and fully gone at 35m.
- Reduced brightness of player names on health bars
- Reduced size of Ultimate indicator on health bars
- Improved stability of health bar position
- Trooper enemy health bars now also change based on your custom enemy color.
- Added Enemy Damaged Color for health bar options in accessibility settings (yellow is default)
- Added Enemy zipline color option to Custom UI colors
- Added minimap ping when the bell sounds
- Added the ability to rebind Down Dash
- Lowered volumes for UI death notification sounds and respawn music